# Dxun, the battle circle and Zuka's relay (TSL, 403DXN, 402DXN): the
# sergeant asked what the battle circle is and the Exile fights in it on
# its terms, every weapon taken for fist and foot (a_set_forfeit, the
# forfeit conditions): Davrel; Kex with swords, the sergeant asked what
# would be fitting ("an honorable choice"); Tagren; Kelborn, who vouches
# for the Exile after his scouts, with the camp's long blade; Bralor with
# no terms, and the Exile is the battle circle's champion; Zuka's relay
# dish (asked what is wrong, [Computer] help offered, Bao-Dur's word,
# the cannoks that ate the phase-pulse converter), its broken wires
# [Repair]ed and its telemetry core reprogrammed [Computer] by Bao-Dur
# leading, Zuka's reward; outside the camp Davrel's challenge to the death refused
# twice (DSimpson's light way: he goes, dishonoured); before Zuka the
# camp's boxes and bags searched (Mandalore's back room is shut until the
# return).
# Starts from the tests' checkpoint:
#   kjk playthrough tsl @dxun_tests_done data/routes/tsl/dxun_circle.route --god
# Walkthrough: DSimpson's "Mandalore" side quests "Win in the Battle
# Circle" and "Repair the Navigational Telemetry"
# (context/walkthroughs/tsl/).
# Then the pieces of the phase-pulse converter taken from the remains of
# the three cannoks that broke it, and the converter brought to Zuka:
# no reward asked (LSP twice), his word to Mandalore.
#
# ASSUMES:
# - Kelborn's scouts done (dxun_tests): the sergeant's start 7 has him
#   vouch for the Exile (c_global_eq), so Kelborn and Bralor follow.
# - Bao-Dur in the party for his lines at Zuka's (c_con_baodurpm), and to
#   lead at the telemetry computer (its spikes are the leader's Computer's).
# - The three cannoks with the converter's pieces roam the jungle; those
#   that fell to the party on the walks before (dxun_camp, dxun_tests) left
#   remains with no tag, so each piece is found by what holds it.
# - Davrel waits by the sentries once beaten in the circle; the zakkeg is
#   already slain, so his zakkeg reply (c_davrel) is not offered.
equip saber          # the saber in hand (the circle takes it, gives it back)
say What is the battle circle?
say I want to fight in the battle circle.
use npc_mandy_sarge  # Davrel: no weapons, no Force, no items
talk
fight 30
talk                 # the sergeant: the match is over
say I want to fight in the battle circle.
say What would be appropriate?
say Let's fight with swords, as you suggested.
use npc_mandy_sarge  # Kex, the challenger: the Exile's terms
talk
fight 30
talk
say I want to fight in the battle circle.
use npc_mandy_sarge  # Tagren: fist and foot; Kelborn vouches after
talk
fight 30
talk
say I want to fight in the battle circle.
use npc_mandy_sarge  # Kelborn: the long blade only
talk
fight 30
talk
say I want to fight in the battle circle.
use npc_mandy_sarge  # Bralor: no terms
talk
fight 30
talk                 # the champion's reward (a_give_q_reward)
equip saber
use g_tresmillow004@7 # the camp's boxes and bags the party can walk to
use g_tresmillow004@8 # (the east barracks' are on no way there; the high
use g_tresmillow004@9 # case by the gate is not useable)
use g_tresmillow004@10
use g_trescivil002@1
use g_trescivil002@2
say What's the problem? # Zuka at his console (a_wire_explode)
say [Computer] I've had some practice
say Then let's get to work fixing it.
use zuka
talk
say [Repair] Fix the broken wires.
use bwire
talk
leader 1             # Bao-Dur leads: the core's spikes are the leader's
say [Computer] Reprogram the core. # Computer's (UT_DeterminesItemCost: 8 less
use tele_comp        # a quarter of it), the telemetry computer up the ramp
talk
leader player
say Both the cables and the telemetry computer are working now. # Zuka:
use zuka             # his parts and spikes (a_ts_reward), Mandalore told
talk
say I don't want to kill you. I refuse. # Davrel by the sentries
say I will not fight you. I refuse your challenge.
exit To_402
module 402dxn
use npc_davrel
talk
use item:phasepulseconver # the phase-pulse converter's pieces: their three
use item:phasepulsecore   # cannoks (c_cannok002 to 004), fallen to the party on
use item:phasepulseps     # the jungle walks before or fought here, searched
exit To_403
module 403dxn
say I have all three parts of the phase-pulse converter. # Zuka (a_pp_start)
say I'm just glad I could help out. # (LSP)
say It was my pleasure to help. I need no reward. # (LSP, a_cannok_reward0)
use zuka
talk
save dxun_champion
